[TITLE]
Precip scaling — WARM rain-scale model.
Single subcatchment, no snow pack ('*' placeholder at token 8), rainfall scale
factor 0.5 at token 9. Air temperature pinned to 50 F so every drop is rain and
the rainfall scale factor is the only active lever. Used by
test_subcatch_scale_factors (mid-run setter effect + runoff continuity) and by
the legacy-vs-C++ regression suite (see tests/regression/data/).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
INFILTRATION         HORTON
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2026
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30

[RAINGAGES]
;;Name Format Interval SCF Source
RG1  INTENSITY 1:00 1.0 TIMESERIES TS1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name RainGage Outlet Area %Imperv Width Slope Curblen SnowPack RainScale SnowScale
S1  RG1  J1  10.0  100  500  0.5  0  *  0.5

[SUBAREAS]
;;Subcatch Nimp Nperv Simp Sperv PctZero RouteTo
S1  0.01  0.1  0.05  0.05  25  OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Subcatch MaxRate MinRate Decay DryTime MaxInfil
S1  3.0  0.5  4.0  7  0

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name Date Time Value
TS1  01/01/2026 00:00 2.0
TS1  01/01/2026 01:00 2.0
TS1  01/01/2026 02:00 0.0

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1  100.0  10.0  0.0  0.0  0.0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name Elev Type
O1  95.0  FREE

[CONDUITS]
;;Name From To Length N InOff OutOff
C1  J1  O1  400.0  0.013  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link Shape Geom1 Geom2 Geom3 Geom4 Barrels
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0  1

[TEMPERATURE]
TIMESERIES TEMPTS

[TIMESERIES]
TEMPTS  01/01/2026 00:00 50
TEMPTS  01/01/2026 12:00 50
